  "reviews": [
    {"id":11626,"productId":479,"userName":"Dara K.","rating":5,"date":"2026-03-02","title":"Handled my rainy commute better than expected","comment":"The waterproof upper kept my socks dry during a wet subway walk. The sole felt steady on slick station stairs. The toe box has enough room for my wider forefoot. It is not the most breathable sneaker once I stay indoors for hours.","helpfulVotes":14,"verifiedPurchase":true,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":1},
    {"id":11627,"productId":479,"userName":"Mason L.","rating":4,"date":"2026-02-11","title":"Good office commute shoe with a practical look","comment":"The black color looks clean enough with chinos at my office. I liked the arch support on a long campus day. Rain beaded off the upper during a short storm. The shoe felt slightly stiff for the first two wears.","helpfulVotes":9,"verifiedPurchase":true,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":0},
    {"id":11628,"productId":479,"userName":"Heejin S.","rating":4,"date":"2025-12-18","title":"Roomy front, secure sole","comment":"My toes did not feel squeezed during a full day of errands. The grip was reliable on wet tile near the train entrance. The cushioning felt comfortable for walking. The coated upper creased faster than I expected.","helpfulVotes":11,"verifiedPurchase":true,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":0},
    {"id":11629,"productId":479,"userName":"Noah P.","rating":3,"date":"2026-01-21","title":"Useful in rain, warm indoors","comment":"I bought these for rainy commutes and they do block puddle splash well. The regular fit works with thin socks. After three hours inside, my feet felt warmer than in mesh sneakers. The outsole still felt stable on a damp sidewalk.","helpfulVotes":7,"verifiedPurchase":false,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":0},
    {"id":11630,"productId":479,"userName":"Sasha M.","rating":2,"date":"2025-11-09","title":"Protection is good but comfort was mixed","comment":"The waterproof claim was fair because light rain did not soak through. The toe box is wide, but the heel rubbed the first week. The shoe felt heavier than my usual commute sneaker. I kept them for rainy days but not daily wear.","helpfulVotes":22,"verifiedPurchase":true,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":1},
    {"id":11631,"productId":480,"userName":"Talia R.","rating":5,"date":"2026-02-26","title":"Airport pockets were actually useful","comment":"The front pocket held my passport and earbuds without digging around at security. The 34 liter size fit two outfits and a spare pair of shoes. The luggage strap made airport walking easier. The navy canvas still looked clean after a weekend trip.","helpfulVotes":18,"verifiedPurchase":true,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":1},
    {"id":11632,"productId":480,"userName":"Owen C.","rating":4,"date":"2026-01-17","title":"Good travel duffel under my budget","comment":"For the price, the pocket layout is better than most soft duffels I tried. The shoulder strap stayed comfortable from the parking lot to the terminal. It fits under a train seat when not overpacked. The bag gets heavy once the shoe compartment is full.","helpfulVotes":12,"verifiedPurchase":true,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":0},
    {"id":11633,"productId":480,"userName":"Mina J.","rating":4,"date":"2025-12-06","title":"Organized enough for short trips","comment":"The quick-access pocket kept my charger separate from clothes. The main compartment opens wide, which made packing easier. The canvas feels sturdy for the price. I wish the strap pad were a little wider when carrying it across the body.","helpfulVotes":10,"verifiedPurchase":true,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":0},
    {"id":11634,"productId":480,"userName":"Eli B.","rating":3,"date":"2026-03-10","title":"Useful pockets, not light","comment":"The side pocket is perfect for toiletries on a one-night trip. The duffel feels structured enough that it does not collapse while packing. Fully loaded, it felt heavier than I wanted on stairs. The navy color hides small scuffs well.","helpfulVotes":8,"verifiedPurchase":false,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":0},
    {"id":11635,"productId":480,"userName":"Jules N.","rating":2,"date":"2025-10-28","title":"Storage is good, strap bothered me","comment":"The pockets are the best part of this bag because I could separate shoes, wallet, and cables. The canvas did not show wear after two trips. The shoulder strap dug in once the bag was packed for a long weekend. I would use it by car, not for long airport walks.","helpfulVotes":20,"verifiedPurchase":true,"reviewSource":"synthetic_demo","reviewImagesCount":1}
